-aegean/minoan/","line":59},{"title":"Egyptian","target":"https://smarthistory.org/period-culture-style/ancient-egyptian-2/","line":59},{"title":"Mesoamerican","target":"https://smarthistory.org/period-culture-style/mesoamerican/","line":59},{"title":"Taíno","target":"https://smarthistory.org/period-culture-style/native-isthmian/taino/","line":59},{"title":"Neolithic","target":"https://smarthistory.org/period-culture-style/prehistoric/neolithic/","line":59},{"title":"![Press release for Ana Mendieta's exhibition at A.I.R. Gallery \"Silueta Series 1979,\" 1979 (A.I.R. Gallery, New York)","target":"https://smarthistory.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/AIRSilueta-2048x1317.jpg","line":61},{"title":"A.I.R. Gallery","target":"https://www.airgallery.org/exhibitions/silueta-series-1979","line":63},{"title":"A.I.R. Gallery","target":"https://smarthistory.org/alternative-art-spaces-new-york-city/","line":67},{"title":"![Ana Mendieta, Anima (Alma/Soul), from the Silueta series, 1976 (1977 print), chromogenic print, 34.3 x 50.8 cm (Smithsonian American Art Museum, Smithsonian Institution, Washington, D.C.) © The Estate of Ana Mendieta Collection","target":"https://smarthistory.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MendietaAlma-2048x1345.jpg","line":73},{"title":"Smithsonian American Art Museum, Smithsonian Institution","target":"https://www.si.edu/object/anima-almasoul:saam_1995.54.1.3","line":75},{"title":"![Ana Mendieta, Untitled, from the Silueta series, 1976 (1991 posthumous print), chromogenic print, 32.7 x 49.21 cm (The Museum of Contemporary Art, Los Angeles) © The Estate of Ana Mendieta Collection","target":"https://smarthistory.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/MendietaUntitledMexicoBeach.jpg","line":85},{"title":"The Museum of Contemporary Art","target":"https://www.moca.org/collection/work/silueta-works-in-mexico-6","line":87},{"title":"That Time Carl Andre Wrote Me a Letter","target":"https://hyperallergic.com/876490/that-time-carl-andre-wrote-coco-fusco-a-letter/","line":135}